market funds related to deferred compensation plans. Due to restrictions on the distribution of these funds, they are classified as restricted cash equivalents and are included in &lt;span style="-sec-ix-hidden:f-715"&gt;&lt;span style="-sec-ix-hidden:f-716"&gt;deferred income taxes and other assets&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; in the Consolidated Balance Sheets.</us-gaap:ScheduleOfFairValueAssetsAndLiabilitiesMeasuredOnRecurringBasisTableTextBlock>
